{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689720/extras/1dac6c5ae33b5e2a03ccce070581da30.avif?t=1749206456\" data-has-big width=800 height=349 /></span><strong>Space Inn</strong> is a narrative management simulator set in a unique world of everyday life\u2026 in space. Take on the role of the owner of a rundown tavern on a forgotten orbital station and try to start over. Serve unusual guests, cook interstellar meals, collect travelers' stories, and find your place in this remote corner of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to save the world. Just try not to burn the recycled dumplings. Not that anyone really knows how they were supposed to taste anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689720/extras/ddac8c59956a91443eff59e22ac3c2fb.poster.avif?t=1749206456\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689720/extras/ddac8c59956a91443eff59e22ac3c2fb.webm?t=1749206456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689720/extras/ddac8c59956a91443eff59e22ac3c2fb.mp4?t=1749206456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique blend of management and storytelling</strong> \u2013 run your tavern, build relationships with the station\u2019s residents, and change their lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A rich space atmosphere</strong> \u2013 a futuristic station with the vibe of a space western, filled with colorful characters and remarkable stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relationship and story system</strong> \u2013 befriend, flirt, help\u2026 and listen. Every traveler has something to say.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization and progression</strong> \u2013 decorate, expand, and upgrade Space Inn to regain control over your life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humor and heart</strong> \u2013 a mix of dark comedy and warm tales about loneliness, hope, and community.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2689720?t=1749206456","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689720/e9ba49a33cfe585ac82ab96c66eaa0ef3861c490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749206456","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689720/6f537996baebdb870581b1b696e7f55b49fd0bf4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749206456","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689720/6f537996baebdb870581b1b696e7f55b49fd0bf4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749206456","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689720/extras/1dac6c5ae33b5e2a03ccce070581da30.avif?t=1749206456\" data-has-big width=800 height=349 /></span><strong>Space Inn</strong> is a narrative management simulator set in a unique world of everyday life\u2026 in space. Take on the role of the owner of a rundown tavern on a forgotten orbital station and try to start over. Serve unusual guests, cook interstellar meals, collect travelers' stories, and find your place in this remote corner of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to save the world. Just try not to burn the recycled dumplings. Not that anyone really knows how they were supposed to taste anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689720/extras/ddac8c59956a91443eff59e22ac3c2fb.poster.avif?t=1749206456\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689720/extras/ddac8c59956a91443eff59e22ac3c2fb.webm?t=1749206456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689720/extras/ddac8c59956a91443eff59e22ac3c2fb.mp4?t=1749206456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique blend of management and storytelling</strong> \u2013 run your tavern, build relationships with the station\u2019s residents, and change their lives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A rich space atmosphere</strong> \u2013 a futuristic station with the vibe of a space western, filled with colorful characters and remarkable stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relationship and story system</strong> \u2013 befriend, flirt, help\u2026 and listen. Every traveler has something to say.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization and progression</strong> \u2013 decorate, expand, and upgrade Space Inn to regain control over your life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humor and heart</strong> \u2013 a mix of dark comedy and warm tales about loneliness, hope, and community.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Space Fox Games","Jujubee S.A."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG",